    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<strong>A simple bra-fighting game that only uses addition! Dive into dungeons and defeat monsters in online play!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strengthen your weapons to defeat monsters in dungeons!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693260/extras/d1d18ce6c2ac55b561c3ce807a7b4c3f.avif?t=1710926114\" width=600 height=336 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description</h2>&quot;We Are SUP&quot; is a bluff-style board game where supporters defeat monsters in dungeons.<br>The only way for weak supporters to survive is to defeat monsters in one blow!<br>Players play buff cards from their dealt hands one by one on the field to accumulate attack power.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693260/extras/RuleSlide_EN_Rule_02.JPG?t=1710926114\" width=600 height=336 /></span><br><br>Cards can be placed face down on the field when the conditions are met. It's an advantageous situation where only the player knows the value of the cards!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693260/extras/RuleSlide_EN_Rule_03.JPG?t=1710926114\" width=600 height=336 /></span><br><br>When the total accumulated attack power from everyone surpasses the monster's health, the attack begins!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693260/extras/RuleSlide_EN_Rule_04.JPG?t=1710926114\" width=600 height=336 /></span><br><br>Declare the highest attack power within the total of the cards played!<br>Be careful because it explodes if you go over.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693260/extras/RuleSlide_EN_Rule_05.JPG?t=1710926114\" width=600 height=336 /></span><br><br>Get rewards and dance for joy!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693260/extras/RuleSlide_EN_Rule_06.JPG?t=1710926114\" width=600 height=336 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2>Supports online multiplayer for up to 6 players!<br>If you go to the adventurer's guild, unknown players waiting for you and your friends are recruiting parties. Of course, you can also become the leader of the party!<br>Whether you aim for maximum happiness by joining hands or defeat all the enemies and monopolize the rewards, it's up to you! Cooperation or interference, it's your choice!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2>- Simple gameplay that only uses addition<br>- Turn-based buff phase and real-time auction attack phase<br>- Supports online multiplayer for up to 6 players<br>- Card deck that changes depending on the number of players<br>- Many effects that couldn't be implemented in analog games<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >For Streamer</h2>Honami Software allows the use of games produced by Honami Software for streaming (videos/live streaming) and monetization.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>A simple bra-fighting game that only uses addition! Dive into dungeons and defeat monsters in online play!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strengthen your weapons to defeat monsters in dungeons!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693260/extras/d1d18ce6c2ac55b561c3ce807a7b4c3f.avif?t=1710926114\" width=600 height=336 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description</h2>&quot;We Are SUP&quot; is a bluff-style board game where supporters defeat monsters in dungeons.<br>The only way for weak supporters to survive is to defeat monsters in one blow!<br>Players play buff cards from their dealt hands one by one on the field to accumulate attack power.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693260/extras/RuleSlide_EN_Rule_02.JPG?t=1710926114\" width=600 height=336 /></span><br><br>Cards can be placed face down on the field when the conditions are met. It's an advantageous situation where only the player knows the value of the cards!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693260/extras/RuleSlide_EN_Rule_03.JPG?t=1710926114\" width=600 height=336 /></span><br><br>When the total accumulated attack power from everyone surpasses the monster's health, the attack begins!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693260/extras/RuleSlide_EN_Rule_04.JPG?t=1710926114\" width=600 height=336 /></span><br><br>Declare the highest attack power within the total of the cards played!<br>Be careful because it explodes if you go over.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693260/extras/RuleSlide_EN_Rule_05.JPG?t=1710926114\" width=600 height=336 /></span><br><br>Get rewards and dance for joy!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693260/extras/RuleSlide_EN_Rule_06.JPG?t=1710926114\" width=600 height=336 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2>Supports online multiplayer for up to 6 players!<br>If you go to the adventurer's guild, unknown players waiting for you and your friends are recruiting parties. Of course, you can also become the leader of the party!<br>Whether you aim for maximum happiness by joining hands or defeat all the enemies and monopolize the rewards, it's up to you! Cooperation or interference, it's your choice!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2>- Simple gameplay that only uses addition<br>- Turn-based buff phase and real-time auction attack phase<br>- Supports online multiplayer for up to 6 players<br>- Card deck that changes depending on the number of players<br>- Many effects that couldn't be implemented in analog games<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >For Streamer</h2>Honami Software allows the use of games produced by Honami Software for streaming (videos/live streaming) and monetization.",
